  "body": "What happens: `cargo test -p xtask` fails on main `c605e5687` in `gate_maps_tests::no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app` with `suites without a Gate map: [\"tool_dxf_profile_mcp\"]`.\n\nCause: `crates/app/tests/tool_dxf_profile_mcp.rs`, added by PR #2100 (STEP -> DXF half profiles, merged as c605e5687), has no `//! Gate map (M4.4): covers ...` line. Its header names only the MCP server (`camcraft_app::mcp::Server`).\n\nFix: add the header line, e.g. `//! Gate map (M4.4): covers app::mcp, app::tool_profile_dxf, app::commands.` (no moved module named as `app::`).\n\nFound by M5's hourly main-health check (clippy clean; xtask test red). Last green: 3c3a58686.\n\nDone means: `cargo test -p xtask` passes on main; the new test file maps to the app suites it covers.\n",
